<blockquote class="uncited"><div>There appears to be another bug, this one involving the Color Code.  R2023.05.08.01 properly exported the color code field to CSV but the latest, and previous release, write a zero to the Color Code column when you exports to CSV.</div></blockquote>The problem was that the export function was reading the Rx CC value from the Channel data not the Tx CC.<br><br>The firmware only ever used the Tx CC, and the Rx CC byte got re-used for the Lat/Lon in the last release<br><br>This is only a problem in the CPS in the Export / Import to CSV and is fixed in the next release<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Oct 03, 2023 2:51 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
